  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hum 302.01 Scope. The rules of this chapter shall apply to public adjudicative hearings scheduled after a determination of probable cause which:\n\n(1) Has not been altered upon reconsideration pursuant to Hum 210.03; and\n\n(2) Has not been resolved through conciliation pursuant to Hum 211.\n\nSource. #6687, eff 2-5-98, EXPIRED: 2-5-06\n\nNew. #8589, INTERIM, eff 3-18-06, EXPIRED: 9-14-06\n\nNew. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hum 300) #8815-A, eff 2-3-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hum100-300.html"
